usage: middle_guard [-h] [--crate-root CRATE_ROOT]
                    [--baseline-dir BASELINE_DIR]
                    {spec-drift,ast-consistency} ...

Run the spec_drift / ast_consistency middle-cheat detectors across the crate
against the frozen baseline commit.

positional arguments:
  {spec-drift,ast-consistency}
    spec-drift          detect silent spec weakening
    ast-consistency     detect silent exec-body edits

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --crate-root CRATE_ROOT
                        crate root (default: .)
  --baseline-dir BASELINE_DIR
                        dir holding the frozen baseline (default:
                        .verus_agent)
